  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:38.840" end="00:45.910" ttm:agent="v1">Mrs. Magic to and fro</p>
      <p begin="00:45.910" end="00:53.230" ttm:agent="v1">Please give me one last show</p>
      <p begin="00:53.230" end="01:00.250" ttm:agent="v1">Loosen my mind from within</p>
      <p begin="01:00.250" end="01:04.600" ttm:agent="v1">Before it starts to wear and thin</p>
      <p begin="01:04.600" end="01:08.970" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:08.970" end="01:12.540" ttm:agent="v1">I don't know</p>
      <p begin="01:12.540" end="01:18.470" ttm:agent="v1">I don't know what I'm doing here</p>
      <p begin="01:18.470" end="01:23.290" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:23.290" end="01:26.890" ttm:agent="v1">I don't know</p>
      <p begin="01:26.890" end="01:32.260" ttm:agent="v1">I don't know what I'm doing here</p>
      <p begin="01:32.260" end="01:40.260" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:43.940" end="01:51.180" ttm:agent="v1">Mrs. Magic Radio</p>
      <p begin="01:51.180" end="01:58.470" ttm:agent="v1">Give me one last chance to show</p>
      <p begin="01:58.470" end="02:05.690" ttm:agent="v1">Tell you what lurks deep inside</p>
      <p begin="02:05.690" end="02:11.220" ttm:agent="v1">Deep inside my battered mind</p>
      <p begin="02:11.220" end="02:14.370" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:14.370" end="02:17.710" ttm:agent="v1">I don't know</p>
      <p begin="02:17.710" end="02:23.870" ttm:agent="v1">I don't know what I'm doing here</p>
      <p begin="02:23.870" end="02:28.740" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:28.740" end="02:32.460" ttm:agent="v1">I don't know</p>
      <p begin="02:32.460" end="02:38.660" ttm:agent="v1">I don't know what I'm doing here</p>
      <p begin="02:38.660" end="02:44.730" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:44.730" end="02:50.030" ttm:agent="v1">Leaving me outside</p>
      <p begin="02:50.030" end="02:53.570" ttm:agent="v1">No, I can't get back in</p>
      <p begin="02:53.570" end="02:59.300" ttm:agent="v1">No, I can't get back in</p>
      <p begin="02:59.300" end="03:04.520" ttm:agent="v1">Leaving me outside</p>
      <p begin="03:04.520" end="03:08.340" ttm:agent="v1">No, I can't get back in</p>
      <p begin="03:08.340" end="03:16.220" ttm:agent="v1">No, I can't get back in</p>
      <p begin="03:16.220" end="03:20.620" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="03:20.620" end="03:26.570" ttm:agent="v1">Mrs. Magic to and fro</p>
      <p begin="03:26.570" end="03:31.110" ttm:agent="v1">Just let me be myself</p>
      <p begin="03:31.110" end="03:35.110" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
